---

Who holds what, both under the licence above:

* Evan Bacon (https://github.com/EvanBacon/expo-crossy-road) - the game this
  port is derived from: its structure, its logic, and the assets bundled here
  from it (models, images and the font).

* G. Korycki - this port to the SF2000 / GB300 handhelds: the C++ sources, the
  software renderer, the libretro core, the asset bakers, the beaver, the
  wordmark, the soundtrack and every sound effect.

No audio from the original project is included. Every sound the game plays was
made for this port, and the upstream archive in upstream/ has had its audio
folder removed.
